        "commit": {
          "author": {
            "email": "63333554+jeswr@users.noreply.github.com",
            "name": "Jesse Wright",
            "username": "jeswr"
          },
          "committer": {
            "email": "noreply@github.com",
            "name": "GitHub",
            "username": "web-flow"
          },
          "distinct": true,
          "id": "855d8df5c4977218fac4fca1dfeada51827cdb65",
          "message": "fix(ci/release): install gui/app workspace deps before tauri build (sq-h1fcs) [OPUS-4.8] (#1016)\n\nThe first release cut (v0.1.0-dev.1, run 27887762864) failed on ALL 5 GUI\ndesktop-bundle rows. The release.yml gui-bundle job installed only per-dir\ndeps — (cd packages/sparq-client && npm install) + (cd site && npm install) —\nand NEVER installed the gui/app frontend's deps. After PR #1003 repointed the\nTauri beforeBuildCommand at the DISTINCT operational frontend\n(`cd ../app && npm run build:tauri`, frontendDist `../app/out`), that command\nfails with `next: not found` because gui/app's node_modules were never installed.\n\nFix: replace the per-dir installs with a single workspace-aware repo-root\n`npm install`. gui/app is a root npm-workspace member, so the root install\nhoists next + cross-env into root node_modules/.bin — exactly the proven-green\ngui.yml `gui-app`/`tauri-e2e` install. cross-env also makes build:tauri's\nNEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH='' shell-portable, retiring the earlier Windows blocker.\n\nReproduced locally (x64-linux): js build:wasm -> root npm install -> gui/app\nbuild:tauri -> gui/app/out with root-relative assets (the path frontendDist\nreads). YAML valid; actionlint clean; bundles remain UNSIGNED (sq-v286.8).\n\nRefs: sq-gl3cf, sq-v286, sq-ixc3.8 (#1003).\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Wright <jmwright.045@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-21T01:47:25Z",
          "tree_id": "ed3a7598d8cdab66af4b7c4239cbcbe76f8634d8",
          "url": "https://github.com/jeswr/sparq/commit/855d8df5c4977218fac4fca1dfeada51827cdb65"
        },
